                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-06-28"><hi rendition="#italic">June 28,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports that the Haitian Government styles the admiral a pirate and
                    disavows his action.)</p>
